    {
      "name": "Shared Rage",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "traits",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The broodiken can't speak with its creator telepathically, but it can magically receive simple ideas, emotions, and images telepathically from its creator while within 100 feet of its creator. The creator can send the broodiken an image of a creature and emotion or simple idea tied to it, such as anger or retrieval, and the broodiken will seek the creature to carry out the emotion or desire. As long as the broodiken is following such an order, it can be more than 100 feet away from its master without wailing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bite",
      "category": "strike",
      "placement": "actions",
